## 5. Experience Gained

### 5.1. Technical Challenges Encountered
*   **Windows-Hadoop Integration**: Local Windows host development suffered from Hadoop dependency mismatches, resolved by dynamically mapping local POSIX binaries using custom Winutils utility packages.
*   **Geospatial Snapping Performance**: Snapping coordinate telemetry to Vienna OGD polygon layers caused driver JVM memory bottlenecks. We optimized search speeds from O(N) to $O(log N)$ using Shapely R-Trees (`STRtree`).
*   **Temporal Data Leakage**: Traditional random splitting breaks time-series dependencies. We addressed this by enforcing a strict chronological split threshold based on window indices.

